                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majwi aako naakajanwa, ndakaalya, nkabela majwi aako akandibeda lukondo abusekelezi bwamoyo, nkaambo ndaambwa muzina lyako, O Jehova Leza wamakamu. ",
