        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jehova wakaamba obo. Na wazumina kuboola, njookuboozya kuti kocindimanina milimo kunembo lyangu, Na ulaandaanya makani aayandika amakani aabuyo, elyo uyooba mbubonya mbuli mulomo wangu, Bantu baboole kulinduwe, utapiluki kulimbabo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
