        },
        {
          "text": "Njookubika kuti ubede bantu aba bulambo bwamundalila buli anguzu. Bayookulwisya, pele tabakooyookuzunda pe, nkaambo ndi ayebo, nzookuvuna, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
